OL,3,GNEWSA'I'd die of loneliness if elderly
OL,4,Acharity closed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which supports about 16,500
OL,7,Folder people each year has warned an
OL,8,Fongoing and growing funding crisis
OL,9,Fcould see it close within six weeks.
OL,11,FAge UK North Yorkshire and Darlington
OL,12,Fsaid, despite cutting costs "as far as
OL,13,Fwe can", it needed to raise #14,000 to
OL,14,Fkeep running while it sought
OL,15,Flonger-term funding.
OL,17,FCarol Norris, 83 and from Darlington,
OL,18,Fstarted using the charity a year ago
OL,19,Fand said she would "probably rot at
OL,20,Fhome and die of loneliness" if it
OL,21,Fclosed.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
