OL,3,GNEWSA'I'd die of loneliness if elderly
OL,4,Acharity closed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive Fay Scullion said the
OL,7,Fcharity was entering a "crisis
OL,8,Fsituation" and blamed rising prices,
OL,9,Fincreased taxes and fewer donations for
OL,10,Fthe funding gap.
